					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": " - "
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeTextMark",
					"TextMarkType": "kbd",
					"TextMarkTextContent": "Switcher"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": " to assign a shortcut to the tab switcher menu; no shortcut is assigned by default. The menu lists tabs in the active pane in tab bar order. Use the up/down arrow keys to select a tab, Enter to switch, and Esc to close the menu. This command is also available in the command panel."
				}
			]
		},
