				{
					"Type": "NodeTextMark",
					"TextMarkType": "kbd",
					"TextMarkTextContent": "Open context menu"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": ". The default is Ctrl+/ on Windows/Linux and Cmd+/ on macOS. It opens the context menu for the current editor content, database rows, search results, or navigation items. Typing / still opens the slash menu."
