				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeTextMark",
					"TextMarkType": "kbd",
					"TextMarkTextContent": "Clicking a parent document title"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": " set, the document tree and pinned documents decide the click action: the expand-only choice expands or collapses immediately, while the double-click choice opens the parent on a double-click or double-tap without changing its expansion state and makes a single click or tap wait about 300 ms; the parent can still be opened from its document menu. A title without child documents still opens directly; clicking a document icon opens an openable document or otherwise changes the icon; a notebook icon always only changes the icon."
				}
			]
		},
